### 1. Authentication Flow
- JWT tokens with access/refresh strategy
- Google OAuth integration for user authentication
- Middleware-based auth with optional and required auth
- User model with Google ID association

### 2. Note Management
- JSON content storage in MySQL
- User association and ownership
- CRUD operations with GORM
- AI integration for content processing

### 3. AI Integration
- OpenAI API integration for content processing
- AI completion endpoints
- Content analysis and suggestions
- Smart categorization features

